WEBVTT

00:08:30.488 --> 00:08:32.618
And I'm like, do I have
something on my face?

00:08:32.642 --> 00:08:34.641
What's happening? I don't know.

00:08:35.083 --> 00:08:37.464
And he asked me with two hands this time.

00:08:37.488 --> 00:08:40.414
"What's going on with all of this?"

00:08:41.834 --> 00:08:44.322
And I realized he's talking
about my hijab.

00:08:45.538 --> 00:08:47.775
And in my head, I said, "Oh, not today."

00:08:47.799 --> 00:08:51.941
But he's a big boss,
he's like my boss's boss's boss,

00:08:51.965 --> 00:08:54.296
and so I put up for 45 minutes,

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:57.473
I put up with him
asking me where I was from,

00:08:58.401 --> 00:08:59.886
where my parents were from,

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.640
my grandparents.